    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜まま: as it is",
     "texto": [
      "It shows that a state continues unchanged: verb in the た or ない form + **まま**, noun + **のまま**, or adjective + **まま**. Example: **くつ を はいた まま、 ねて しまいました** (I fell asleep with my shoes on)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜ままに: according to; following",
     "texto": [
      "It expresses acting in line with an instruction, a wish or a state: noun + **のままに** / verb + **ままに**. **こころ の ままに いきる** means living by one's own desires. It is common in written style."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
